# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# This app is a single-page app behind a data router, so /invoices/123,
# /customers/abc and the installed app's own start_url (/dashboard) are all
# routes that exist only in the browser. Without this rule the host looks for
# a file at that path, doesn't find one, and returns its 404 page — so the
# app appears completely broken the moment it is installed, and a refresh on
# any screen but "/" loses the supplier's place.
#
# Real files are served first; this only catches what the filesystem misses.
# The 200 matters: it rewrites rather than redirecting, so the URL the
# supplier is on stays the URL they see.
/*  /index.html  200
